<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BankWest half year net profit dips.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BankWest half year net profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Aug 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     76.7 vs 68.1</p>
<p>    Net					48.3 vs 49.5</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	    8.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Bank of Western Australia Ltd is a Perth-based regional bank 51 percent owned by Bank of Scotland.  </p>
<p>    Interest income		     467.8 vs 431.9</p>
<p>    Interest expense		    306.2 vs 283.7</p>
<p>    Total assets (billion)	     10.9 vs 10.2</p>
<p>    Other income			   54.6 vs 57.8</p>
