<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 15</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 1</p>
<p>    Tax					28.4 vs 22.2</p>
<p>    Interest				306.2 vs 283.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   10.8 vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
